# Set now although nothing is packaged yet: FORMATS is check-only until the GL 2.0 back end
# exists. Without this the derived id would be PROG00001, which `gl1-probe` also derived before
# it was given one - a collision that only shows up the first time two of them are installed.
#
# **Four letters, then five digits.** This was `GL2C00001`, which has a `2` in the letter field
# and which the console's installer refuses outright - measured on gl1-probe's `GL1P00001`,
# whose deploy staged cleanly and was then never indexed
# (`20 Invalid TitleId`, `AppPromote Error ... 0x80bd000a`). Caught here before this app ever
# packaged anything. app.mk now checks the shape.
EXPLICIT_TITLE_ID=1
TITLE_ID=GLTC00001
TITLE_NAME="GL2 Cube"
APP_SUBTITLE="Programmable shader pipeline OpenGL 2.0 demonstration"
TITLE_CATEGORY=big-app
TITLE_VERSION=01.00
FORMATS=check-only
